Runtime Call Stack Simulation (Image + Audio + Video MCP)

Case 1: health_check
1. mcp.server.fastmcp.FastMCP._call_tool
2. image_audio_mcp.server.health_check
3. image_audio_mcp.services.health_check
4. image_audio_mcp.services._get_default_*_model

Case 2: generate_image (text-only)
1. mcp.server.fastmcp.FastMCP._call_tool
2. image_audio_mcp.server.generate_image
3. image_audio_mcp.services.generate_image
4. image_audio_mcp.services._get_workspace_root
5. image_audio_mcp.services._resolve_output_path
6. autobyteus.utils.file_utils.resolve_safe_path
7. autobyteus.multimedia.image.image_client_factory.ImageClientFactory.create_image_client
8. Image client generate_image
9. autobyteus.utils.download_utils.download_file_from_url
10. image_audio_mcp.services._safe_cleanup

Case 3: edit_image (with input + mask)
1. mcp.server.fastmcp.FastMCP._call_tool
2. image_audio_mcp.server.edit_image
3. image_audio_mcp.services.edit_image
4. image_audio_mcp.services._get_workspace_root
5. image_audio_mcp.services._normalize_media_sources
6. image_audio_mcp.services._normalize_media_source
7. autobyteus.utils.file_utils.resolve_safe_path
8. autobyteus.multimedia.image.image_client_factory.ImageClientFactory.create_image_client
9. Image client edit_image
10. autobyteus.utils.download_utils.download_file_from_url
11. image_audio_mcp.services._safe_cleanup

Case 4: generate_speech
1. mcp.server.fastmcp.FastMCP._call_tool
2. image_audio_mcp.server.generate_speech
3. image_audio_mcp.services.generate_speech
4. image_audio_mcp.services._get_workspace_root
5. image_audio_mcp.services._resolve_output_path
6. autobyteus.utils.file_utils.resolve_safe_path
7. autobyteus.multimedia.audio.audio_client_factory.AudioClientFactory.create_audio_client
8. Audio client generate_speech
9. autobyteus.utils.download_utils.download_file_from_url
10. image_audio_mcp.services._safe_cleanup

Case 5: generate_video
1. mcp.server.fastmcp.FastMCP._call_tool
2. image_audio_mcp.server.generate_video
3. image_audio_mcp.services.generate_video
4. image_audio_mcp.services._get_workspace_root
5. image_audio_mcp.services._resolve_output_path
6. image_audio_mcp.services._normalize_media_sources for input_images, input_audios, input_videos
7. autobyteus.utils.file_utils.resolve_safe_path for local media paths
8. autobyteus.multimedia.video.video_client_factory.VideoClientFactory.create_video_client
9. Video client generate_video
10. autobyteus.utils.download_utils.download_file_from_url
11. image_audio_mcp.services._safe_cleanup
